    "It goes to the retried benchbar process only, never on a command line or to disk.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It goes to the retried benchbar process only, never on a command line or to disk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It has no secrets, no personal paths and no names: passwords, keys and tokens are masked, your home folder, username and the names of this Mac are replaced, and site configs are reduced to their key names. REDACTIONS.txt inside lists every replacement.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
